","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010502","city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[60,58,48,44,46,56],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"百济第十代君主，責稽王的长子，幼而聰惠，儀表英挺，王愛之，不離左右，及王薨，繼而卽位。其父责稽王在与乐浪郡的战争中被杀，汾西王继承王位。在位期间，延续了对乐浪郡（中原王朝在朝鲜半岛的行政机构）的战争。永兴元年二月，成功攻占乐浪郡的西部地区。同年十月，被乐浪太守派出的刺客刺杀身亡。","tc":"百濟第十代君主，責稽王的長子，幼而聰惠，儀表英挺，王愛之，不離左右，及王薨，繼而卽位。其父責稽王在與樂浪郡的戰爭中被殺，汾西王繼承王位。在位期間，延續了對樂浪郡（中原王朝在朝鮮半島的行政機構）的戰爭。永興元年二月，成功攻占樂浪郡的西部地區。同年十月，被樂浪太守派出的刺客刺殺身亡。","en":"The 10th ruler of Baekje and the eldest son of King Chaekgye. Intelligent from youth and striking in appearance, he was dearly loved by the king, who kept him ever at his side. Following the death of his father in the war against Lelang Commandery, King Bunseo succeeded the throne. During his reign, he continued the conflict against Lelang Commandery—an administrative commandery of the Zhongyuan dynasties on the Korean Peninsula. In the second month of the first year of Yongxing, he captured the western regions of Lelang Commandery. In the tenth month of that same year, he was assassinated by an assassin dispatched by the Governor of Lelang.","jp":"百済第十代君主。責稽王の長男。幼少より聡慧で容貌に優れ、父王に愛されて常に左右を離れず、王が薨去すると即位した。父の責稽王が楽浪郡との戦いで戦死したため、汾西王が王位を継承。在位中は楽浪郡（中原王朝が朝鮮半島に置いた行政機関）との戦争を継続した。永興元年二月、楽浪郡の西の攻略に成功したが、同年十月、楽浪太守の放った刺客により暗殺された。","kr":"백제의 제10대 군주이자 책계왕의 장남입니다. 어려서부터 총명하고 지혜로우며 풍채가 늠름하여 부왕의 지극한 사랑을 받아 늘 곁을 떠나지 않았고, 부왕이 붕어하자 뒤를 이어 즉위했습니다. 부왕인 책계왕이 낙랑군과의 전쟁 중에 전사하자 분서왕이 왕위를 계승했습니다. 재위 기간 동안 낙랑군(중원 왕조가 한반도에 설치한 행정 기구)과의 전쟁을 이어갔습니다. 영흥 원년 2월, 낙랑군의 서부 지역을 성공적으로 공략하여 차지했습니다. 같은 해 10월, 낙랑 태수가 보낸 자객에게 암살당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1050915","remark":"普武","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"汾西","nameTc":"汾西","nameEn":"Bunseo","nameJp":"汾西","nameKr":"분서","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"汾西","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workY